WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.042
Russia shares this big,

00:00:01.042 --> 00:00:02.419
long border with Finland.

00:00:02.419 --> 00:00:03.044
And Finland

00:00:03.044 --> 00:00:04.254
just joined NATO,

00:00:04.254 --> 00:00:06.339
the Western military alliance.

00:00:06.339 --> 00:00:07.841
They’re also about to let American troops

00:00:07.841 --> 00:00:09.217
come to Finland.

00:00:09.217 --> 00:00:10.635
And Russia does not like this.

00:00:10.635 --> 00:00:11.803
So as a response,

00:00:11.803 --> 00:00:13.471
they have been sending migrants

00:00:13.471 --> 00:00:14.931
from like war zones

00:00:14.931 --> 00:00:16.391
that are looking for asylum

00:00:16.391 --> 00:00:17.934
and safety to this border.

00:00:17.934 --> 00:00:19.477
And they're putting them on bicycles.

00:00:19.477 --> 00:00:20.353
And they have nowhere to go

00:00:20.353 --> 00:00:21.813
but into Finland.

00:00:21.813 --> 00:00:22.897
Now, Russia knows that

00:00:22.897 --> 00:00:24.065
Finland is required

00:00:24.065 --> 00:00:25.775
to let these asylum seekers in,

00:00:25.775 --> 00:00:26.776
and the hope here is that

00:00:26.776 --> 00:00:28.361
this flood of migrants will create

00:00:28.361 --> 00:00:30.030
discord and division

00:00:30.030 --> 00:00:31.698
within Finnish society

00:00:31.698 --> 00:00:32.407
and will make them angry

00:00:32.407 --> 00:00:33.825
at this decision to join NATO

00:00:33.825 --> 00:00:34.868
or to let U.S.

00:00:34.868 --> 00:00:35.493
troops in.

00:00:35.493 --> 00:00:36.911
Putin is using these migrants

00:00:36.911 --> 00:00:38.788
as a weapon in his hybrid warfare

00:00:38.788 --> 00:00:39.706
against the West.

00:00:39.706 --> 00:00:40.290
So in response,

00:00:40.290 --> 00:00:41.583
Finland actually closed

00:00:41.583 --> 00:00:43.293
these land border crossings.

00:00:43.293 --> 00:00:44.252
And so now you have this

00:00:44.252 --> 00:00:46.296
terrible situation of migrants

00:00:46.296 --> 00:00:47.005
just sitting there,

00:00:47.005 --> 00:00:48.590
not able to go anywhere

00:00:48.590 --> 00:00:50.258
in these terrible conditions.

00:00:50.258 --> 00:00:51.217
If you want to better understand

00:00:51.217 --> 00:00:52.927
global politics, follow along for more.

